            <ArticleTitle>Antituberculosis Drug-Induced Liver Injury with Autoimmune Features: Facing Diagnostic and Treatment Challenges.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5741896</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1155/2017/5741896</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors present a case report of antituberculosis drug-induced liver injury that offered diagnostic challenges (namely, the possibility of drug-induced autoimmune hepatitis) and treatment difficulties.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
